		<dict>
			<key>candidate</key>
			<string>Pixaud / PixAud / pixaud / Pix Aud / Pix-Aud</string>
			<key>checkedOn</key>
			<string>2026-08-27</string>
			<key>finding</key>
			<string>Exact-name public results identify Pixaud as a named figure in the 1991/1992 Torg publication “Pixaud's Practical Grimoire.” This is public entertainment-property use, not a trademark-status result, but it makes the candidate an avoidable pre-existing word rather than a clean software identity.</string>
